This module is a port of Draco 1.5.7's mesh and point cloud decoder
(src/draco/compression/decode.cc, point_cloud/ (sequential and kd-tree
decoders, algorithms/ with the dynamic integer and float kd-trees), mesh/
(edgebreaker with its standard, predictive and valence traversals, sequential),
attributes/ (sequential and kd-tree attribute decoders, prediction schemes and
their transforms), entropy/ (rANS), bit_coders/, core/ (DecoderBuffer, varints),
attributes/ (quantization and octahedron transforms), mesh/ (corner tables and
traversers), metadata/metadata_decoder.cc and
javascript/emscripten/decoder_webidl_wrapper.cc)
